# OPIc Sample Answer — Day49

## Online Reservation Problem

> I once had a problem with an online reservation.
>
> I had booked a hotel room for a weekend trip, but when I checked my reservation, the date was incorrect.
>
> I contacted the hotel immediately and explained the situation.
>
> Fortunately, they were able to change the reservation.
>
> I ended up staying at the hotel on the date I originally wanted.
>
> It was a little stressful, but everything worked out in the end.

---

## Useful Expressions

### I once had a problem with ~

한 번 ~에 문제가 있었어요.

### I contacted ~ immediately.

즉시 ~에 연락했어요.

### I explained the situation.

상황을 설명했어요.

### I ended up ~ing.

결국 ~하게 되었어요.

### Everything worked out in the end.

결국 모든 일이 잘 해결됐어요.

